        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Express No. 6</strong> is a short, atmospheric first-person horror. The protagonist’s name is Maxim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an ordinary passenger who wakes up in a compartment: tea, string lights, New Year’s radio. At some point, something happens- and you’re left alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137880/extras/3dc5c95da1ca83ef29a6345890479471.poster.avif?t=1785577395\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137880/extras/3dc5c95da1ca83ef29a6345890479471.webm?t=1785577395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137880/extras/3dc5c95da1ca83ef29a6345890479471.mp4?t=1785577395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to reach the driver’s cab and stop the train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A camera will help: it “reveals” what’s inside the gifts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make it in time and you’ll survive- and receive your New Year’s “gift.”</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137880/extras/6d8c70d15111f1dd5b4bc6dc9fb8496c.poster.avif?t=1785577395\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137880/extras/6d8c70d15111f1dd5b4bc6dc9fb8496c.webm?t=1785577395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137880/extras/6d8c70d15111f1dd5b4bc6dc9fb8496c.mp4?t=1785577395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Features</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Short but intense horror (≈40–60 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unusual camera: the lens “reveals” gifts </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A timer and quick decisions under pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized discoveries and events in each playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personal “gift” that depends on your playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content warning:</strong> sudden sounds, flashing lights, stressful situations.</p>",
